.godot/

# Godot .import sidecars can contain source-controlled import settings, and
# .uid sidecars preserve stable resource identifiers. Keep both visible to Git.
# Only the disposable editor/import cache above is ignored.

# Generated QA output and local user state. Historical tracked review captures
# remain in assets/art/review; ignore rules do not remove existing tracked files.
.qa_logs/

# Build and publish output from Godot, .NET, and local packaging workflows.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/build/
**/publish/
**/artifacts/
.vs/
.cache/
dist/
temp/

# Disposable binaries, packages, logs, and scratch files. Game resources and
# intentional review evidence under assets/ are not covered by these rules.
*.exe
*.zip
*.log
*.stderr
*.stdout
*.tmp
*.cache
